[I] Fast prime counting C/C++ library

[T] primecount is a command-line program and C/C++ library that counts the
[T] number of primes below a given limit using highly optimized, OpenMP
[T] parallelized implementations of combinatorial prime counting algorithms
[T] such as Deleglise-Rivat and Gourdon.

[U] https://github.com/kimwalisch/primecount

[A] Primecount Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

